# Language Rules — Citytaxi Horw

## UI Language: German Only (de-CH)

All user-facing text — buttons, labels, headings, status messages, error messages, placeholders, tooltips — **must be written in German**.

```
❌ NEVER use Turkish in any user-facing text
❌ NEVER use English in any user-facing text
❌ NEVER mix languages in a single string (e.g. "Müşteri Alındı / Fahrgast abgeholt")
✅ ALWAYS write UI text in German (de-CH) with correct Umlauts
```

## Examples

| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |
|---|---|
| Müşteri Alındı / Fahrgast abgeholt | Fahrgast abgeholt |
| Bitte warten / Lütfen bekleyin | Bitte warten… |
| Accept / Kabul Et | Annehmen |
| Loading... / Yükleniyor... | Wird geladen… |

## Code Comments

Code comments may be written in **English or Turkish** — this rule applies only to **user-facing strings rendered in the UI**.

## Scope

This rule applies to every file under `src/` — components, pages, API response messages shown to users, and data files under `src/data/`.
